node_modules
.next
out
.env.local
*.log
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Every sibling of .next is a build directory, never source: the throwaway
# used to typecheck without touching the deployed one (.next-verify), the
# zero-downtime swap pair (.next-new / .next-old), and any dist dir a dev
# server is pointed at via NEXT_DIST_DIR so it cannot write into the build
# the live service is serving (.next-dev).
#
# A glob rather than a list — the list was already three entries long and the
# fourth one got committed, 239 files of build output, because nobody thought
# to extend it before running `git add -A`.
.next-*/
